Third-party assets used by CompuRunner
=========================================

Only the files under assets/runner/ are shipped. Each one is traced below.

Kenney (CC0 1.0)
----------------
Platformer Characters, Generic Items, Background Elements, Simple Space,
UI Pack, Game Icons, Digital Audio, Impact Sounds, and Interface Sounds.
By Kenney Vleugels, https://kenney.nl
License: Creative Commons Zero 1.0, https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
Credit is not required. The runner, buttons, and sound effects come from these packs.

Platformer Pack Industrial (CC0 1.0), also by Kenney:
https://kenney.nl/assets/platformer-pack-industrial
File used: platformIndustrial_065.png, the riveted metal plate in
assets/runner/ground/plate.png. The charcoal fill under the plate is a flat colour.

Pixel Platformer (CC0 1.0), also by Kenney, 1.2, 07-10-2023:
https://kenney.nl/assets/pixel-platformer
File used: tile_0014.png, the heart in assets/runner/icons/heart.png, with a white rim added.

Urban Landscape (CC0 1.0)
-------------------------
By Luis Zuno (@ansimuz), https://opengameart.org/content/urban-landscape
Files used: Sky-layer.png and buildings-layer.png, scaled as crisp pixels in
assets/runner/world/sky.png and buildings.png.
License: Creative Commons Zero 1.0. Credit is not required. A link back to
OpenGameArt.org is appreciated.
The night city is the same two layers tinted darker (assets/runner/world/night-sky.png
and night-buildings.png). A separate night-cloud composite was not usable as a
clean layer, so no extra sky pack is shipped.

Sci-fi platformer tiles (CC0 1.0)
----------------------------------
"Sci-fi platformer tiles (32x32)" by bart, 2 January 2014.
https://opengameart.org/content/sci-fi-platformer-tiles-32x32
File kept: techblocks2.png, the older ground strip in assets/runner/ground/strip.png.
The current run draws the industrial plate instead of this strip.
License: Creative Commons Zero 1.0. Attribution is optional. A link back to
OpenGameArt.org is appreciated.

