Lucide (ISC)
------------
Outline icons in assets/runner/icons/, from https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide
(lucide-static). The runner uses cpu, ram (memory-stick), hard-drive, usb,
keyboard, mouse, database, code-xml, braces, gpu (microchip), floppy (save),
router, wifi, plug, battery, cloud, lock, key, magnet, monitor, terminal,
lightbulb, circuit-board (the short), server, cable, and bug.
These are Lucide drawings under the ISC license. The Lucide project license
also keeps the MIT text for icons that were derived from Feather. Both texts
are included so the upstream notice stays intact. The heart and the shield
are not Lucide: the heart is Kenney and the shield is Tabler, listed above.

